The swatches read `var(--myelin)`, so each one shows its own accent only if the token system re-scopes `--myelin` on elements with `data-accent`. If `styles.css` only scopes it on `:root`, the four swatches will look the same. The design tokens have no per-accent swatch values to fall back on, so that scoping is the thing to check.

